OL,3,GNEWSABeekeeper turns to community to
OL,4,Arestore lost hives
OL,5,
OL,6,FA beekeeper who lost most of his hives
OL,7,Fpartly due to wet weather has thanked
OL,8,Fhis local community for helping him
OL,9,Frestock his supply.
OL,11,FDennis Kennedy, from Ivybridge, Devon,
OL,12,Flost about 40,000 honey bees from 11
OL,13,Fcolonies at the start of this year
OL,14,Fleaving him with just 4,000 or 5,000 in
OL,15,Fone colony by March.
OL,17,FIn a bid to restore his colonies he
OL,18,Fbuilt 45 bee boxes to collect swarms of
OL,19,Fbees and turned to social media to
OL,20,Frecruit volunteers to put them out.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
